      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What are the biggest social media mistakes Nashik dermatology clinics make?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) No content calendar — sporadic posting kills algorithm reach. (2) No Reels + video (Instagram algorithm heavily favours Reels). (3) Text-heavy educational posts without visual + carousel format. (4) ASCI-violating language + guaranteed-outcome claims. (5) No before-after (or non-compliance-safe before-after). (6) No WhatsApp/DM automation — leads leak. (7) Doctor-only voice with no clinic-culture content. (8) Ignoring Stories + broadcast channels. (9) English-only in Nashik where Marathi + Hindi + English outperform. (10) No local-community engagement (schools + events + neighbourhood associations).</div>
